<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81150" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιβλύζω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιβλύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>boil</i> or <i>bubble all round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύματα περιβλύει σπιλάδεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.788
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ δ᾽ ἔβλυσεν αἷμα βοείῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					10.150
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ . . νάμασι περιβλύζουσα</span>
			<i>gushing</i> with streams, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				397a25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.acc.,
				<i>cause to gush around</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνην αὐτῷ περιβλύσαι νέκταρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					3.25
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
